{
  "id": "c08",
  "title": {
    "zh-CN": "探索·anal"
  },
  "start": "c08_n0001",
  "nodes": {
    "c08_n0001": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "暑假第十天的傍晚，特蕾西又抱着个快递盒进了房间。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0002"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0002": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这次拆出来的东西，比上次那个跳蛋还让她脸红——一个金属做的肛塞，底座是颗宝石，紫红色的，打磨得亮闪闪；塞进去的部分细长，一头圆。旁边还压着一小瓶润滑液。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0003"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0003": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西盯着这两样东西，脸一阵红一阵白。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0004"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0004": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "买跳蛋的时候是手滑。买这个，她是清醒地、一点一点加进购物车，再按下付款的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0005"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0005": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她想得清楚，就是想试试。可东西真到手，又怂了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0006"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0006": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她把自己锁进浴室，拧开花洒，让热水淋下来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0007"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0007": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "后穴不比小穴，得慢慢来。这是她查了好几天才弄明白的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0008"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0008": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她先挤了一团润滑液，涂在肛塞上，又涂在指尖。然后背靠着墙，把腿张开一点，慢慢把手指往后面探。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0009"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0009": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "凉的。她哆嗦了一下，咬住下唇。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0010"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0010": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "第一根手指进去的时候，她整个人绷紧了，又强迫自己放松。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0011"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0011": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "好紧。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0012"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0012": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她慢慢动，加润滑，又挤了更多。等两根手指能进去的时候，她已经喘得不成样子，脸红到脖子根。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0013"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0013": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她拿起那个肛塞，对准自己，一点一点往里推。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0014"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0014": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯……哈……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0015"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0015": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "宝石堵头最后"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0016"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0016": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咕"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0017"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0017": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "地一下嵌进去，卡在穴口外。她腿一软，差点滑坐下去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0018"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0018": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "缓了好一会儿，她才直起身，试着走了两步。身体里多了个东西，每走一步都提醒她。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0019"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0019": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她低头，从镜子里看见自己——脸红着，后穴里嵌着一颗紫红色的宝石，亮闪闪的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0020"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0020": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她盯着镜子里的自己，忽然冒出个念头：要是让卢卡看见，他会是什么表情。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0021"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0021": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "晚上，卢卡来了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0022"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0022": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西已经坐在床边等他，睡裙松松地罩在身上。她反常地安静，两只手绞着睡裙下摆。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0023"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0023": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你怎么了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0024"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0024": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡问。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0025"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0025": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……我。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0026"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0026": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西低下头，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0027"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0027": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "又买了个东西。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0028"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0028": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "又是什么。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0029"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0029": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她没说话，站起来，背过身去。然后弯下腰，把睡裙从下往上撩到腰际，内裤褪到腿弯。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0030"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0030": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她塌下腰，把屁股朝他撅了起来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0031"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0031": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你……看。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0032"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0032": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她的声音抖得厉害，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0033"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0033": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "看见了没。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0034"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0034": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡整个人僵在那儿。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0035"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0035": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "灯光下，她的两瓣屁股浑圆地翘着，中间那圈浅色的后穴，嵌着一颗紫红色的宝石，随着她紧张的呼吸，微微一起一伏。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0036"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0036": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……你。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0037"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0037": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡的呼吸都重了，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0038"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0038": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你什么时候……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0039"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0039": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "白天。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0040"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0040": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西把脸埋进被子里，不敢看他，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0041"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0041": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我自己弄的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0042"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0042": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她撅在那儿，声音闷闷的："
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0043"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0043": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你不是说，我买什么都配合吗。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0044"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0044": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我说的是……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0045"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0045": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡张了张嘴，说不出话来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0046"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0046": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "它还在里面。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0047"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0047": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西小声说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0048"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0048": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你要不要，自己抽出来看看。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0049"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0049": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡走到床边，单膝跪下去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0050"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0050": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他伸出手，指腹碰到那颗宝石。凉的，沾着她后穴里渗出来的一点润滑液，油亮亮的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0051"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0051": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西抖了一下。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0052"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0052": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你……慢点。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0053"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0053": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0054"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0054": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "有点紧。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0055"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0055": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡捏住那颗宝石，往外轻轻一抽。肛塞从她后穴里滑出来一点，带出黏黏的润滑液。特蕾西"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0056"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0056": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咿"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0057"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0057": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "了一声，两条腿都软了软。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0058"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0058": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咕……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0059"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0059": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "肛塞整个抽出来的时候，她的后穴被撑得微微张着，一圈嫩肉还来不及合拢，泛着油亮的水光。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0060"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0060": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这里……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0061"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0061": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡盯着那儿，声音很低，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0062"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0062": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "好小。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0063"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0063": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0064"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0064": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西别过脸，耳尖红得要滴血，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0065"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0065": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你倒是继续啊。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0066"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0066": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡没说话。他拿起床头那瓶润滑液，挤了一大团在手上，又涂在手指上。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0067"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0067": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你要进来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0068"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0068": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西撅着屁股说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0069"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0069": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "得先……用手指。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0070"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0070": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他照做。沾满润滑液的手指贴上去，慢慢探进那个还张着的小口。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0071"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0071": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西整个人绷紧了，后穴紧紧夹住他的手指。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0072"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0072": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "别夹。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0073"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0073": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡说，声音轻下来，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0074"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0074": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "放松。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0075"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0075": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0076"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0076": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喘着，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0077"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0077": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我在放松了……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0078"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0078": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他慢慢动，又加了一根手指，仔仔细细地扩张，把润滑液涂得进去又出来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0079"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0079": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咕啾……咕啾……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0080"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0080": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "哈……卢卡……好怪……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0081"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0081": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "疼吗？"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0082"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0082": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他问。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0083"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0083": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "不疼。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0084"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0084": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西摇头，屁股却不自觉地往后迎了迎，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0085"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0085": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "就是……好胀。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0086"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0086": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这里比前面紧多了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0087"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0087": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0088"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0088": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0089"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0089": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西把脸埋得更深，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0090"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0090": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你少说两句。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0091"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0091": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "等后穴完全软下来，卢卡才直起身，脱了衣服，扶着自己抵上去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0092"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0092": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他没用太大力气，只把顶端顶在那圈还油亮的小口上。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0093"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0093": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我进了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0094"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0094": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0095"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0095": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0096"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0096": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西抓着床单，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0097"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0097": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你慢点。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0098"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0098": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他慢慢往里推。后穴紧紧地箍着他，比小穴更窄、更热。特蕾西仰起脖子，短金发凌乱地铺在背上。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0099"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0099": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "胀……好胀……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0100"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0100": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喘着，断断续续，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0101"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0101": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "撑……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0102"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0102": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "疼吗？"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0103"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0103": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡停下来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0104"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0104": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "不疼。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0105"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0105": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她摇头，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0106"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0106": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "就是胀。你……别停。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0107"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0107": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他继续。一点一点，直到整个都埋了进去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0108"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0108": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "两个人同时喘出声。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0109"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0109": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "全进去了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0110"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0110": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，声音发颤，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0111"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0111": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡，你……在我后面了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0112"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0112": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡没动，撑在她身上，让她适应。过了好一会儿，特蕾西自己扭了扭腰。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0113"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0113": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你动。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0114"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0114": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0115"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0115": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他开始动。很慢，一下一下。后穴裹得紧，每一下都像被从里到外地吸着。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0116"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0116": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咕啾……咕啾……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0117"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0117": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西趴在床上，屁股高高翘着，两瓣臀肉随着他的动作一下下地颤。她伸手，绕到前面，摸自己湿透了的小穴。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0118"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0118": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "前面……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0119"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0119": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喘着，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0120"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0120": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "也想要。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0121"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0121": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡一边从后面顶，一边伸手，覆上她前面的小穴，手指探进去，就着她已经泛滥的水搅动。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0122"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0122": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咕啾……咕啾……啪……啪……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0123"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0123": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "哈啊……卢卡……两边都……好舒服……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0124"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0124": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她的胸压进床单里，乳肉被挤得从身侧溢出来一点。她仰着头，嘴里的声音碎成一片。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0125"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0125": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "啊……卢卡……再快……再深……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0126"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0126": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡加快了。肉棒在她后穴里进出，带出润滑液和水声，混着他手指在她小穴里的搅动。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0127"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0127": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "啪……啪……咕啾……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0128"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0128": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "要……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0129"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0129": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西喘着，两条腿直打颤，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0130"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0130": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡，我要……要去了……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0131"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0131": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "唔……去了……卢卡……咿嗯……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0132"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0132": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她整个人绷紧了，后穴一下下地收缩，绞得他发紧，前面的小穴也猛地一缩，水从指缝里溢出来。过了几秒，她才一点点软下去，趴伏在床单里，胸口剧烈起伏。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0133"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0133": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡没停。他从后面顶得更重，喘得越来越急。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0134"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0134": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0135"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0135": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他低低地喊，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0136"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0136": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我要……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0137"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0137": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "进来……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0138"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0138": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西回手，抓住他的手腕，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0139"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0139": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "都给我……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0140"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0140": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "唔……特蕾西……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0141"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0141": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡重重地顶到最深处，整个人绷紧了，趴下来贴在她背上，身体一下下地颤着，低低地喘出来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0142"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0142": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "哈啊……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0143"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0143": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西感觉到他在自己后穴里一阵阵地释放，烫得她整个人都软了。她没说话，只反手勾着他的脖子，把他拉下来，让他压在自己背上。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0144"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0144": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "过了好一会儿，卢卡的呼吸才慢慢平下来。他还埋在她身体里，两人的汗混在一起，贴得严丝合缝。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0145"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0145": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……你好重。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0146"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0146": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西小声说，脸还埋在被子里。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0147"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0147": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡笑了一下，撑起来，慢慢退出去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0148"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0148": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他抽出来的那一刻，特蕾西"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0149"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0149": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0150"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0150": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "了一声，后穴还张着，慢慢合拢。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0151"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0151": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0152"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0152": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她翻过身，仰躺着看他，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0153"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0153": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "帮我擦擦。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0154"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0154": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡拿了纸巾，很轻地替她把腿间和后面擦干净。特蕾西红着脸任他擦，等他擦完，才伸手，把他拉进怀里。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0155"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0155": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "下次。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0156"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c08_n0156": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她贴着他的胸口，小声说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0157"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0157": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你还想吗。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0158"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0158": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡低头亲了亲她的额角。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0159"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0159": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "想。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0160"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0160": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0161"
      }
    },
    "c08_n0161": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你提的，我都想。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0162"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c08_n0162": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西没说话，只把脸埋进他颈窝，抱得更紧。床单上，那颗紫红色的宝石肛塞还静静地躺着，在灯下闪着点光。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c09",
        "nodeId": "c09_n0001"
      }
    }
  }
}
